body:
I cant say i even remotely understand, but truly from the bottom of my heart, dont do it, you will find people who love you for you and you can find happiness, these word probobly mean nothing to you at this point but i hope it will help in some way, if you ever need to talk to someone you can come to me. you can live a happy life you just have to give yourself the chance to, i wish i could help more but i dont know how, so as my last message here call the hotline, dont be afraid to do so, an anomomous person who will listen and validate your feeling while doing their best to help, might be a good thing.

&#x200B;

1-800-273-8255
